    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thief stole a sacred artifact from the underground city of Lichnos, and since then, his hometown has fallen into decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On his deathbed, he hired a mercenary to return the artifact to its rightful place. What he didn't know is that this same artifact was the seal that protected Lichnos from the evil that lurked beneath...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ancient underground city amidst a monster invasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new skills and tools to traverse the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through fast turn-based battles against monsters that overrun the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with survivors to reforge your weapons and learn new magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find better gear to withstand hard-hitting beasts that await below</p></li></ul>",
